1940 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.95 .55 .15]/P 111 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[261.58354 690.2406 433.3472 690.2406 261.58354 675.7072 433.3472 675.7072]/Rect[258.15788 674.7989 436.77287 691.1489]/AP<</N 1941 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A0)/Contents(SIG-NAVBITS-01: Navigation data bits inside the snapshot [Deviates, impact low]\nWe do: No data bits. Every snapshot is a clean 1 ms of code.\nIf we got it wrong: Affects about 2.5% of snapshots \(a bit edge lands inside 1 ms one time in 20, and the bit actually changes about half the time\). Those snapshots have weak peaks, so Pd drops slightly at every C/N0. Too rare to explain the strength gap.\nTo close: Ablation: add random bit edges in the simulator and rerun the faithful arm.)/T(SIG-NAVBITS-01)/BM/Multiply>>
endobj

