1964 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.45 .6 .95]/P 1000 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[361.14717 458.7324 475.2005 458.7324 361.14717 444.199 475.2005 444.199]/Rect[357.7215 443.29069 478.62617 459.64073]/AP<</N 1965 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A2)/Contents(SIG-CODE-01: GPS spreading codes [Verified]\nWe do: IS-GPS-200 Gold-code generator, upsampled to 4 MHz.\n\nSIG-PRNS-01: Which satellites \(PRNs\) [Paper silent, our choice, impact low]\nWe do: PRNs 1, 11, 19 and 24.\nIf we got it wrong: Negligible. All C/A codes share the same three autocorrelation values, so their CAF maps look statistically alike.\nTo close: No task. Recorded as our choice.)/T(SIG-CODE-01 + SIG-PRNS-01)/BM/Multiply>>
endobj

