<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.95 .55 .15]/P 1000 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[186.33806 175.72998 341.10749 175.72998 186.33806 161.1966 341.10749 161.1966]/Rect[182.9124 160.28826 344.53315 176.63832]/AP<</N 1997 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A18)/Contents(SIG-DELAYRANGE-01: Range of random code delays [Deviates, impact low]\nWe do: Delays between 0.05 and 0.95 ms. The paper uses the full 0 to 1 ms.\nIf we got it wrong: Negligible for the detector: our training tiler wraps around the edge, so edge peaks would give the same tiles. It only affects the full-map scan, which does not wrap, and edge peaks are a few percent of maps.\nTo close: Fix: draw over the full range in the next faithful run.)/T(SIG-DELAYRANGE-01)/BM/Multiply>>
