<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.9 .25 .25]/P 396 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[143.7713 582.7405 348.02195 582.7405 143.7713 568.2071 348.02195 568.2071]/Rect[140.34564 567.29879 351.4476 583.6488]/AP<</N 2017 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A0)/Contents(CAF-STDDET-01: The classic detector, as a baseline [Not done, impact high]\nWe do: Not implemented. All our curves are for the neural detector only.\nIf we got it wrong: Without it CAF-STDDET-02 cannot run, and the paper's claim that the neural detector beats the standard one is untested in our reconstruction. A missing tool rather than a correctness risk.\nTo close: Experiment: threshold the peak of |CAF|^2 on our simulated maps, sweep the threshold, plot the ROC per C/N0.)/T(CAF-STDDET-01)/BM/Multiply>>
