<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.95 .55 .15]/P 1066 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[378.03556 520.4347 475.4358 520.4347 378.03556 505.90129 475.4358 505.90129]/Rect[374.6099 504.99296 478.86146 521.343]/AP<</N 2045 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A8)/Contents(TILE-STRIDE-01: Step size when sliding over the map [Deviates, impact medium]\nWe do: Our full-map scan steps 6 cells at a time in delay, so it looks at about 1 in 6 positions.\nIf we got it wrong: Affects the per-map end of the Gate A band \(Pd 0.58 at 39 dB-Hz\). At stride 1 that number would drop, which widens the band but keeps the published 0.84 inside it. The per-cell numbers come from separate tiles and are unaffected.\nTo close: Experiment: stride-1 rerun of the full-map scan.)/T(TILE-STRIDE-01)/BM/Multiply>>
