<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.35 .78 .45]/P 1066 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[320.07695 133.018 457.50236 133.018 320.07695 118.48462 457.50236 118.48462]/Rect[316.65129 117.57628 460.928 133.92635]/AP<</N 2065 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A18)/Contents(FUSE-RULE-01: How the K snapshot outputs are combined \(eq. 11\) [Verified]\nWe do: Sum over the K snapshots of \(logit_H1 - logit_H0\). For a two-class softmax this difference is exactly log\(p1/p0\), so the sum is the log of eq. \(11\)'s product. run_fullscan.py and run_phase2.py do this for every tile of the stride-6 interior grid: 40 Doppler rows \(bins 5 to 44\) by 661 delay centres \(samples 18 to 3978\). run.py does it only at the three scored tiles of each scenario.)/T(FUSE-RULE-01)/BM/Multiply>>
endobj

