<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.45 .6 .95]/P 1701 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[190.381 496.5675 369.4419 496.5675 190.381 487.5035 369.4419 487.5035]/Rect[188.24452 486.937 371.57838 497.134]/AP<</N 2073 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A0)/Contents(COUNT-FIG9EVENT-01: What counts as a success in Fig. 9 [Paper silent, our choice, impact low]\nWe do: The pre-registered event is L == 2 exactly \(GMM count, coherent phase, gamma = 1\). As a sensitivity, also L == 2 with each true signal matched by its own component mean within 600 Hz and 18 samples.\nIf we got it wrong: Low for the verdict. The two events differ by at most 0.11 at any of the 15 scored points, and both fail 13 of 15. Counting L >= 2 instead fails 14 of 15.\nTo close: Nothing to run. Keep L == 2 as primary \(it was pre-registered\) and quote the matched event beside it.)/T(COUNT-FIG9EVENT-01)/BM/Multiply>>
