<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.9 .25 .25]/P 1537 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[117.6378 506.4394 240.2044 506.4394 117.6378 491.906 240.2044 491.906]/Rect[114.212139 490.99769 243.63007 507.34773]/AP<</N 2105 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A2)/Contents(CAF-STDDET-02: The paper's own theory curves \(Fig. 7, solid lines\) [Not done, impact high]\nWe do: Not reproduced. 0053 digitized only the dashed curves and left the solid ones out as not a reproduction goal.\nIf we got it wrong: This is the cheapest direct test of the strength gap. Skipping it leaves Gate A's main residual explained only by ruling other causes out.\nTo close: Experiment: implement their equations with K = 6, digitize the solid curves from thesis Fig. 3.16 \(byte-identical to the preprint's Fig. 7; wider axes than the journal's\), and fit the one free convention, how C/N0 sets alpha_i and sigma^2, testing the candidates named in SIG-CN0DEF-01.)/T(CAF-STDDET-02)/BM/Multiply>>
