<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.98 .82 .2]/P 1537 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[117.64119 435.6894 227.15616 435.6894 117.64119 421.156 227.15616 421.156]/Rect[114.21552 420.24769 230.58182 436.59773]/AP<</N 2113 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A6)/Contents(RES-FIG7-HIGH-01: Fig. 7 at 42 and 45 dB-Hz: the saturated curves [Implemented, unverified, impact low]\nWe do: Per cell, Pd 1.0 at every Pfa we report, five seeds. No per-map run at 42 or 45: the full scan stops at 39.\nIf we got it wrong: Low. If the per-map reading is theirs \(EVAL-CASE-01\), our per-map Pd at 42 and 45 is untested, and at 39 it is already 0.58 against their 0.86.\nTo close: Experiment: add 42 and 45 dB-Hz to the stride-1 per-map scan.)/T(RES-FIG7-HIGH-01)/BM/Multiply>>
