<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.45 .6 .95]/P 1332 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[289.413 203.768 477.62196 203.768 289.413 189.23462 477.62196 189.23462]/Rect[285.98735 188.32628 481.0476 204.67635]/AP<</N 2177 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A6)/Contents(COUNT-LRANGE-01: Which signal counts the GMM may choose \(L from 1 to 4, or 0\) [Paper silent, our choice, impact low]\nWe do: L from 1 to 4 \(config l_max: 4\). If no cell passes, L = 0; if exactly one passes, L = 1 without a fit.\nIf we got it wrong: Low for the verdict, which counts only L == 2. But the cap binds: in our Fig. 9 run L = 4 is common \(77 of 300 maps at 0 Hz, 0 us\), so our histograms hide how far the over-split goes. L = 0 also occurs \(86 of 300 maps at the same point, where coincident peaks can cancel\) and counts as a miss.\nTo close: Ablation: allow l_max = 6 in the next counting run and report the L histogram beside the l_max = 4 one.)/T(COUNT-LRANGE-01)/BM/Multiply>>
endobj

